			},
			"date": "2021-05-21T18:07:16.000Z",
			"content": "Was literally looking for info on this less than an hour ago 🎩\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1166157,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/stephenjbell/status/1395806217470103552",
			"author": {
				"name": "Stephen Bell",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/stephenjbell",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/0a83de8fbd44277a4a746a99ccdab53929806f0d20f602e72817fdbc53cbefbf.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2021-05-21T18:18:29.000Z",
			"content": "Is Distributed Persistent Rendering the incremental build that I've seen you mentioned 11ty 1.0? Or are they two different things?\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1166158,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat/status/1395809885875474433",
			"author": {
				"name": "Zach Leatherman",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/zachleat",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/d9711a9ad30ae05a761e4a728883bcbdd852cbf7d41437925b0afc47a8589795.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2021-05-21T18:33:04.000Z",
			"content": "They are related conceptually in that they both can improve build times but are different. --incremental would still generate the templates at Build Time. DPR allows developers to punt on a specific template until after build: when the first end-user requests it in the browser.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/stephenjbell\"></a>",
			"type": "reply",
			"via": "webmention"
		},
		{
			"id": 1166210,
			"parentId": 0,
			"url": "https://twitter.com/SteveALee/status/1395811017930780675",
			"author": {
				"name": "Steve Lee",
				"url": "https://twitter.com/SteveALee",
				"avatarUrl": "https://avatars.webmention.io/pbs.twimg.com/c6d1e0d460a2fe6e6e95133edbc77fc277ad1437560b6a119b2c186c44af0ec8.jpg"
			},
			"date": "2021-05-21T18:37:34.000Z",
			"content": "That's a tease campaign if you ask me :)\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
