			"content": "Is it going to be $9/mo —&gt; $499/user/mo... actually you smell Enterprisey just call me? \n\nNot proper serverless if not... call me\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
