			},
			"date": "2021-05-21T20:15:05.000Z",
			"content": "BTW, we just published a small e-commerce website built with Eleventy. Shop part is at Shopify store, but the Preact-based pricing calculator is on top of Eleventy rendered static site. Future features to get more API integration possibilities could be a great thing.\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/eleven_ty\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://twitter.com/zachleat\"></a>\n<a class=\"u-mention\" href=\"https://www.zachleat.com/\"></a>",
